Z||000002||Spyder||07-24-2000||08:25 PM||||On the rear yes, no problem.<BR>The front, it would be very, very close.<BR>On the front I believe the smallest width tire to fit that wide of a rim would be a 215/40/17. I believe you would have a little rubbing but not much. The offset would have to be at least a 45mm offset.<P>Please note: I am not 100 percent that they will work.<BR>So don't hold me responsible if they don't work.||||reg||1
